# Example client — Hetzner DNS

Copy to `clients/<yourname>/terraform.tfvars` (gitignored) or pass `-var-file` when running Terraform from `dns/terraform/environments/hetzner/`.

```hcl
zone_name                = "example.com"
create_mailcow_records   = true
mail_hostname            = "mail.example.com"
mail_server_ipv4         = "203.0.113.10"
dkim_txt_by_name = {
  "dkim._domainkey" = "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEA...REPLACE_FROM_MAILCOW_UI"
}
dmarc_txt = "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:postmaster@example.com"
```
